    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46911767e13c5ef674fc9e75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了迎战『阪神两岁雌马大赛』、\n我们已经顺利完成了所有准备工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e326bf8999edebfb0910085f10eefdf468e5ec945646d9888b21458250ed72a",
