      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在信心满满地挑战比赛的前一天。\n中午时分、我们抵达了\n离阪神比赛场不远的一家酒店。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a849b5629f70593b6ecafb758c546bd9bd82407ebf3817eb060815238e33def3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
